WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.436
The Photos page groups your day for you.

00:00:02.436 --> 00:00:07.490
Newest first, by date. Every one stamped with the time and where you were standing.

00:00:08.198 --> 00:00:16.288
Open a photo and tag it. Tag it for the stormwater inspection, or for the seeding record, and it flows to that report on its own.

00:00:16.996 --> 00:00:26.616
The stamp is a rendering, not paint. The clean original is always kept, and every element of the stamp can be turned off per photo, forever.

00:00:27.328 --> 00:00:32.497
Every photo is also a pin on the map, where you were standing when you took it.

00:00:32.497 --> 00:00:37.338
Show today's, a date range, or all of them, and tap a pin to see the shot.

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:41.419
From the pin, link the photo to the work it shows.

00:00:41.419 --> 00:00:45.058
The layer keeps it, and the photo remembers the layer.

00:00:45.058 --> 00:00:46.810
Evidence, both directions.
